      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Recurrent corneal erosion (RCE) is a disease which often occurs in women. The authors report one case of RCE in the right eye of a 38 year old woman age. Clinical signs and clinical course under treatment are described. The pathogenesis and treatment of RCE are also described."},
